api_language → api_languages; mcp_language → mcp_languages;
api_tracks → api_module/api_languages; docs_site → docs_module/docs_framework;
saas_starter_module → saas_infra_module; saas_auth → saas_auth_module/provider;
saas_billing → saas_billing_module/provider; include_admin → saas_admin_dashboard.
Use `riso migrate` or `riso update` (dry-run preview). Leftover 1.x keys
fail closed. Do not pass dual-path aliases after remap.
